    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "well im not exactly feeling \"fatal\" or anything lol, i just feel a bit woozy. if i cant get in to see the doctor for a week, what else can i do? is there some kind of supplement or maybe more water or salt or something i can take instead of the lisinopril for a few days just to let my body settle without doubling up on the meds? i just want a way to fix the dizziness so i can keep going about my day.",
